# P5 U3 sign on the page (contract-p5-unit3.md §4.1 as amended by §9.12, §9.22, §9.27-§9.30, §9.35). 45 steps (§9.29 said 31; +1 `key Escape` closes the dialog a refused sign leaves open, §9.12/§9.22; +11 after review S1: signed-field click, handle, arrow nudge, Read-mode click; +2 after review S2: Enter on a focused sig-target opens the dialog).
# Fixture fixtures/p5/empty-sigfield.pdf sha 07e46851... (1581 B). Page 0: Signature1 [72,620,340,680] centre (206,650), Signature2 [360,620,540,680] (grey /AP);
# page 1 (/Rotate 90): Signature3 page-space [500,72,560,300]. Rects are y-down page pt. Free-name rule: a field added without a name is the first
# Signature<n> (n from 1) no field in the document uses -> Signature4 here (1-3 taken), Signature1 on hello.pdf.
# The drawn field is drag (72,300)+(220,60) -> ~[72,300,292,360], centre (182,330); its rect is checked in tests/p5-drive-field.test.mjs via pick() (§9.35),
# never here. revision is absolute (each mutate, undo, redo adds 1). No `mode` expect after a `sign` step (§9.30: sign moves to annotate).
# A refused sign leaves #cert-sign-dialog open (sign.dialog non-null): send `key Escape` (§9.12) before any `click` after a refused sign.
# Every `sign` step's contents are [redacted] in the report (§2.6); no fixture or output name here contains the password.
{"cmd":"open","path":"fixtures/p5/empty-sigfield.pdf","expect":{"doc":{"name":"empty-sigfield.pdf","pageCount":2,"readOnly":false},"signatures":[{"field":"Signature1","rect":[72,620,340,680],"status":"empty"},{"field":"Signature2","rect":[360,620,540,680],"status":"empty"}],"dirty":false,"revision":0}}
{"cmd":"mode","contents":{"mode":"forms"},"expect":{"mode":"forms","revision":0}}
